--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
=== SUMMARY ===
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data sources : 2 reads bound as StateFlow via EnergyFlowPageViewModel -> energyFlowPageSourceOf(): EnergyStore.energyFlow (web useEnergyFlow,
               real-time Section-1 diagram) + EnergyStore.energyStats(id, days) (web energy-stats useQuery, PRIMARY ▸ summary cards + charts +
               history table). Scope = SelectedVehicleStore (web useSelectedVehicle); units = SettingsStore.settings() (web useUnits). No HTTP in the view.
charts       : RadialGauge (SoC) + AreaChartWrapper (daily energy kWh) + 2x BarChartWrapper (daily distance, daily efficiency) — all from the A3
               components.charts library (Vico / Compose canvas), never a webview.
si/units     : SI read off the wire; total_distance_m via convertDistanceFromSI at the display boundary (prefs.distanceDisplay/formatDistance),
               energy Wh->kWh via convertEnergyFromSI (prefs.energyDisplay/formatEnergy), efficiency Wh/m->Wh/km|Wh/mi via prefs.efficiencyDisplay
               (web *1000 / *1609.344). No miles/mph/kWh stored or computed; the /energy/flow snapshot's pre-scaled kW/kWh/% are rendered verbatim,
               mirroring the web page's raw fmtNumber reads (web parity).
states       : energy-stats is the PRIMARY gate (loading/empty/error/success). The flow feed renders its own diagram-or-fallback surface (greyed-out
               N/A nodes) so Section 1 is never hidden, and each chart/table shows its own empty-state (web per-section truthiness). Documented
               divergence (Honesty #9): an absent / no-vehicle stats payload routes to the friendly No-Data surface via EnergyStats.hasData; a real
               response (always period_days > 0) renders the full body.
a11y/theme   : the three charts carry Modifier.semantics contentDescription (the web aria intent, translation_energyFlow_*_aria); the gauge has a
               merged contentDescription (RadialGauge); icons decorative (contentDescription=null); ≥48dp Select targets; all color via
               MaterialTheme.colorScheme + ChartPalette (paletteColor) + PanelAccent/TeslaTokens (A2 tokens) — dynamic color + dark theme; typography
               via the role components (PageTitle/PanelTitle/BodyText/Caption/MetricLabel/MetricValue). Compose-native (no webview).
nav          : Destinations 'energyFlow' -> /energy-flow pre-existing (Destinations.kt L82, count unchanged); host wired via PageHosts.register("energyFlow");
               deep link auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost; EnergyFlowPageHost.register() added to TeslaSyncApplication. DataContainer unchanged
               (EnergyStore already exposes energyStats + energyFlow; container already exposes energyStore/settingsStore/selectedVehicleStore).
